## Description: Not the HomeStationMarker add-on, and it does nothing: a private placeholder for the author's own console. An add-on early in the game's load order names HomeStationMarker as an optional dependency, and this placeholder requires Error Catcher, so the game loads Error Catcher ahead of everything. DO NOT INSTALL.
